% TR-059 (Hattori, Yokoi, "The Concepts and Facilities of SIMPOS File System", ICOT TR-059, 84.04)
% PDF page 19, printed folio 17. Figure 3.5 Index File (record = links | key | data); Section 3.2(4) index buffer and index file marker.
% Transcribed by eye from 300dpi code-line crops (work/tr0059/m*.png), F2 2026-11-23. Courier font: punctuation clear.
% Bullet descriptions ('o To ...') are given as % comments; only the indented code lines are printed code.

% "An index buffer has additional predicates which deal with the key field:"
% o To get the record key
             :record_key(Buffer,Key)
% o To set the record key
             :set_record_key(Buffer,Key)
% "Operations on an index file marker include:"
% o To set a key
             :key(File_Marker,Key)
% o To get a key
             :set_key(File_Marker,Key)
% (as printed: the descriptions are swapped -- ":key" is under "To set a key" and ":set_key"
%  under "To get a key"; not corrected)
